<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Storylines — {{ paper.name }}</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ root }}static/fonts.css?v={{ v }}">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ root }}static/style.css?v={{ v }}">
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
{% set ed = None %}
{% include "_masthead.html.j2" %}
<main class="podcast-page storylines" id="feed">
  <h1>Storylines</h1>
  <p class="pod-intro">Ongoing threads in ethics and compliance, each with a dated timeline of every story the paper has covered, newest first.</p>
  {% if not threads %}<p class="pod-empty">No storylines yet. They appear as soon as a story is linked to an ongoing thread.</p>{% endif %}
  <ul class="thread-list">
  {% for t in threads %}
    <li><a href="{{ t.slug }}.html"><span class="tl-title">{{ t.title }}</span>
      <span class="tl-meta">{{ t.count }} {{ 'story' if t.count == 1 else 'stories' }} · {{ t.first }}{% if t.first != t.last %} to {{ t.last }}{% endif %}</span>
      <span class="tl-latest">Latest: {{ t.latest }}</span></a></li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
<p class="pod-disclaimer">Internal reference only: AI-assisted, not legal advice, and not for forwarding to clients. Check the original source before relying on any story.</p>
</main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
